# Allowlist: service images build from the repo root but need only the workspace
# definition (pyproject.toml, uv.lock), the shared packages and the services.
# Everything else (pgdata/, .env, .venv/, data/, docs/) stays out of the build context,
# so no secret or database file can be copied into an image.
*
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!packages/
!services/
**/__pycache__
**/*.egg-info
**/tests/
**/.gitkeep
